  "body": "Phase-1 close-out for #5670 (implementation of §8, design PR #5667).\n\n**What this PR does**\n- Adds the phase-1 migration record (`doc/2026-11-24T06-23-32Z_report_id5670_phase1_atlas_python_migration/`): the 2026-11-07 landing of `atlas_search.py`, `eval3.py`, and the golden-311 corpus into `pkgs/atlas-search/` was never recorded on #5670 — this verifies it and inventories every §8 row at 2026-11-24.\n- Index line in `doc/README.md`.\n- `pkgs/atlas-search/eval/README.md`: provenance section now states the in-repo copies are canonical and the outside copies retired.\n\n**Parity evidence (verified fresh 2026-11-24)**\n- Outside sources (hatch-personal `workspace/turso-atlas/scripts/`) SHA-256 match the README's recorded provenance hashes exactly — no drift since migration.\n- In-repo `atlas_search.py`: AST-identical to source (treefmt formatting only). `eval3.py`: AST-identical modulo docstring path text. `golden-311.json`: JSON-identical (311 queries).\n\n**Remainder, filed + enqueued in the same pass** (repo-health-code-pilot tasks 21684, 21685, 21687, 21688, 21689):\n- #14128 aggregator absorption verification (embed_pass3 / embed_onnx / atlas-ingest)\n- #14129 atlas-backup → fleet search backup verb\n- #14130 wrapper retirement once the serve role is the production path\n- #14131 golden-311 run from the new home (acceptance criterion 3)\n- #14132 historical archive/delete (laptop, gated)\n\nDocs-only change; no code or dependency changes. Refs #5670 (phase 1 of it; the issue stays open for the slices above).\n\nLeft unmerged for Felix's review.\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-24T06:26:01Z\",\n    \"session_id\": 